Global : $HOME/.config/tctl/$GLOBAL_CFG
Project: $PROJECT/$PROJECT_CFG
VM     : demo
Share  : $PROJECT

==> Env layers (later override earlier):
  + $PROJECT/.env
  + $PROJECT/.env.local

Effective environment
  API_URL                  = https://x                         # $PROJECT/.env
  API_TOKEN                = ********                          # $PROJECT/.env.local
  DB_PASSWORD              = ********                          # $PROJECT/.env
  MY_KEY                   = ********                          # $PROJECT/.env
  AUTH_HEADER              = ********                          # $PROJECT/.env
  CREDENTIAL_X             = ********                          # $PROJECT/.env
  SECRET_SAUCE             = ********                          # $PROJECT/.env
  PLAIN                    = 3                                 # $PROJECT/.env.local

Secret-looking values are masked; use --show-secrets to reveal.

Diff: VM /etc/profile.d/tart-provision.sh → local layers
--- vm:/etc/profile.d/tart-provision.sh
+++ local (rendered)
@@ -15,3 +15,4 @@
 # --- $PROJECT/.env.local ---
 export PLAIN=2
 export API_TOKEN=********
+export PLAIN=3
